1
00:00:00,064 --> 00:00:02,804
(Penny:)I can't believe Sheldon was
gonna ask Amy to marry him.

2
00:00:02,801 --> 00:00:04,301
(Sheldon(on phone):)I know.
I also can't believe

3
00:00:04,302 --> 00:00:06,232
(Leonard:)he watched what we did
on that couch

4
00:00:06,237 --> 00:00:08,467
(Leonard:)and still sits on it.
Yeah.

5
00:00:10,074 --> 00:00:11,844
(Sheldon(on phone):)Hello.

6
00:00:11,843 --> 00:00:13,173
(Leonard:)Hey, buddy.
How you doing?

7
00:00:13,178 --> 00:00:14,208
(Sheldon:)Better.

8
00:00:14,212 --> 00:00:16,212
(Sheldon:)Did Wil and Adam leave?
Yeah.

9
00:00:16,214 --> 00:00:18,584
(Sheldon:)Do you think they're
going to put my outburst

10
00:00:18,583 --> 00:00:19,913
(Sheldon:)in the documentary?

11
00:00:19,918 --> 00:00:22,018
(Penny:)Definitely.
Oh, yeah.

12
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:25,520
(Sheldon:)Well, there's no point
in dwelling on it.

13
00:00:25,523 --> 00:00:27,093
(Sheldon:)As the Vulcans say,

14
00:00:27,091 --> 00:00:31,061
“Kup-fun-tor
ha'kiv na'ish Du stau.”

15
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:34,230
(Penny:)Do you know what that means?
No.

16
00:00:34,232 --> 00:00:35,402
(Penny:)Are you telling the truth?

17
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,500
Nirsh.

18
00:00:38,803 --> 00:00:41,203
(Sheldon:)Well, this is ridiculous.
Being upset about Amy

19
00:00:41,206 --> 00:00:42,936
(Howard:)all the time
isn't accomplishing anything.

20
00:00:42,941 --> 00:00:44,671
(Sheldon:)If I want to resolve
this situation,

21
00:00:44,676 --> 00:00:46,306
(Sheldon:)then I need to take action.

22
00:00:46,311 --> 00:00:48,511
(Penny:)What are you gonna do?
I'm going to find her

23
00:00:48,513 --> 00:00:49,643
(Sheldon:)and ask her to marry me.

24
00:00:49,647 --> 00:00:52,077
(Sheldon:)And if she says yes,
we can put this behind us

25
00:00:52,083 --> 00:00:53,813
(Sheldon:)and resume our relationship.

26
00:00:53,818 --> 00:00:55,518
(Sheldon:)And if she says no...

27
00:00:55,520 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)well, then
she can just ponfo miran.

